[[{{PAGENAME}}]] is a [[Shinto shrine]] located in [[Japan]]. It worships [[Mount Tate]] and and has three sub shrines is at a high altitude of 3,003 meters<ref>https://zekkeijapan.com/spot/index/1147/</ref>

It was historically a major site of [[Shugendo]].<ref>{{Cite web |title=Oyama Jinja - Toyama |url=https://en.japantravel.com/toyama/oyama-jinja/2595 |access-date=2023-04-07 |website=JapanTravel |language=en}}</ref>

It is an [[Ichinomiya]] of [[Etchū Province]]

It has no [[Honden]] but instead has [[Mount Tate]] as its [[Kannabi]].

