{{Infobox religious building| religious_affiliation = [[Shinto]]
| religious_affiliation = [[Shinto]]
| image                 = 20 Tateyama from Mikurigaike 1998-7-17.jpg
| coordinates           = {{OSM location map|coord={{coord|36.588334|N|137.464835|E}}|fullscreen-option=0|zoom=9|float=center|width=210| caption=|title=|mark-coord1={{coord|36|34|23.44|N|137|37|4.51|E}}|label1=峰本社|label-pos1=bottom|mark-size1=8| mark-coord2 = {{coord|36|34|59.19|N|137|23|33.07|E}}|label2=中宮祈願殿|label-pos2=bottom|mark-size2=8|mark-coord3={{coord|36|36|27.48|N|137|18|53.40|E}}|label3=前立社壇|label-pos3=top|mark-size3=8}}
| deity                 = [[Ame-no-Tajikarao]], [[Izanagi]],<br>
[[Amitābha]] (formerly)
